# Local analysis working files, wherever they land. .lab/ above covers the
# scratch directory itself; a copy of the game executable, a disassembler
# project or a memory dump is the one thing in this tree that must never reach
# a commit, because a public repo keeps serving every blob by SHA long after a
# branch is deleted. Second line of defence, by file extension.
*.exe
*.gpr
*.gar
*.rep/
*.dmp
*.bin
